# Normalize line endings across platforms.
#
# core.autocrlf is set to true system-wide on this machine, which checks out
# CRLF working-tree files from LF blobs. These rules pin both the stored and
# the checked-out form to LF so the working tree matches the committed
# content regardless of any platform or user setting.
#
# Extension list derived from the tracked files actually present across the
# six Stargate variant repositories: js, css, html, json, md, and .gitignore.

# Baseline: auto-detect text, check out LF. Binary files are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit rules for the file types present in this repository.
*.js        text eol=lf
*.css       text eol=lf
*.html      text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf

# Dotfiles tracked in the variant repositories.
.gitignore      text eol=lf
.gitattributes  text eol=lf
